---
heading: Something about me,
---
...as I understand myself at this point:

I tend to think about how our perceptions are shaped by experiences or circumstances, often without us realizing it. Finding connections between seemingly unrelated things, understanding how people form their perspectives. Often questioning my own beliefs along the way.

I enjoy collecting [books](http://books.jonlo.xyz) (and trying to read them occasionally). Making [sounds](http://www.instagram.com/nowovertone) to stay present. Having too many tabs open (literally and metaphorically) and too many bookmarks saved. Writing [posts](https://www.threads.com/@ljedwin/post/Db48rYmlEee) to indulge my [weird](https://www.threads.com/@ljedwin/post/Db0aAsvIzG-) sense of [humor](https://www.threads.com/@ljedwin/post/Da-ngxiARBD).

Now I have this place to write, mainly for my future self and to help my present self think more clearly, I hope something here will make you go "hmm..."
